# Dashboard-local ignore list.
#
# These patterns are already covered by the repo-root .gitignore for *commits*,
# but `az webapp up` decides what to put in its (forward-slash, Linux-safe) zip
# by reading the .gitignore in the folder it is run from. Keeping a copy here
# guarantees the manual Oryx deploy uploads ONLY source — Azure's Linux builder
# then runs `npm install` + `npm run build` itself, so we never ship
# Windows-built node_modules or a stale .next bundle.
#
# See docs/manual-dashboard-deploy.md for the deploy procedure.

# Dependencies — Oryx reinstalls these on the server.
node_modules/

# Build output — Oryx rebuilds these on the server.
.next/
out/

# Incremental TypeScript build info (large, machine-local).
*.tsbuildinfo

# The corrupt Windows zip-deploy artifact that caused the backslash failure.
deploy.zip
*.zip

# Local env files (never deploy secrets; production values live in App Settings).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
